{"learnerLanguage":"pt","level":"A2","objectivesMet":["Ask about the rent","Book a viewing"],"scenario":{"characterName":"Sarah","objectives":["Ask about the rent","Ask what's included","Book a viewing"],"situation":"Você viu um anúncio de apartamento na Queen Street e liga para a proprietária, Sarah, para perguntar o aluguel e marcar uma visita.","title":"Ligar para marcar uma visita"},"targetLanguage":"en","turns":[{"speaker":"character","text":"Hi, this is Sarah from Queen Street Apartments. How can I help?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Hello, I see the apartment in the internet. Is available?"},{"speaker":"character","text":"Yes, it's still available. It's a one-bedroom on the second floor."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"How much is the rent?"},{"speaker":"character","text":"It's twelve hundred dollars a month."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Is include the water and the light?"},{"speaker":"character","text":"Water is included, but electricity isn't."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Ok. I can visit the apartment in Saturday?"},{"speaker":"character","text":"Saturday morning is taken, but I can do Saturday at 2 p.m."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Yes, Saturday at two is perfect. Thank you very much."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Great, see you then!"}]}